          "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | [Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [oxlint](https://oxc.rs/docs/guide/usage/linter) ([source](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/tree/HEAD/npm/oxlint)) | [`1.89.0` → `1.90.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/oxlint/1.89.0/1.90.0) | ![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/oxlint/1.90.0?slim=true) | ![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/oxlint/1.89.0/1.90.0?slim=true) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>oxc-project/oxc (oxlint)</summary>\n\n### [`v1.90.0`](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/blob/HEAD/npm/oxlint/CHANGELOG.md#1900---2026-10-27)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/compare/oxlint_v1.89.0...oxlint_v1.90.0)\n\n##### 🚀 Features\n\n- [`831cdf1`](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/commit/831cdf1) oxlint: Require mininum oxlint-tsgolint version v7.0.2005 ([#&#8203;28118](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/issues/28118)) (camc314)\n- [`d1b00f4`](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/commit/d1b00f4) linter/typescript: Implement no-unsafe-enum-assignment rule ([#&#8203;28117](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/issues/28117)) (camc314)\n- [`165c91f`](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/commit/165c91f) linter/typescript/await-thenable: Support `allowMixedPromiseArrays` option ([#&#8203;28116](https://redirect.github.com/oxc-project/oxc/issues/28116)) (camc314)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/harryzcy/harryzcy.github.io).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xODguMiIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjE4OC4yIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiXX0=-->\n",
